msgid "Your SD card is read-only"
msgstr "Tu tarjeta SD es de solo lectura"

#: internal/settings/storage_ui.c
msgid ""
"Your SD card is read-only after a file system error. You can't save new "
"files or changes to this card. This can happen after an unexpected shutdown."
msgstr ""
"Tu tarjeta SD es de solo lectura debido a un error del sistema de archivos. "
"No puedes guardar archivos nuevos ni cambios en esta tarjeta. Esto puede "
"ocurrir tras un apagado inesperado."

#: cmd/jawaka-launcher/main.c
msgid "Your SD card is read-only. Nothing new can be saved to it."
msgstr ""
"Tu tarjeta SD es de solo lectura. No se puede guardar nada nuevo en ella."

#: internal/settings/storage_ui.c
msgid ""
"Your SD card is read-only. The cause couldn't be determined. You can't save "
"new files or changes to this card."
msgstr ""
"Tu tarjeta SD es de solo lectura. No se pudo determinar la causa. No puedes "
"guardar archivos nuevos ni cambios en esta tarjeta."

#: internal/settings/storage_ui.c
msgid ""
"Your SD card is still protected. Turn off your device, repair the card on a "
"computer, safely eject it, then insert it and turn your device on to check "
"it again."
msgstr ""

#: cmd/jawaka-launcher/main.c
msgid "Your SD card is waiting for repair. Nothing new can be saved to it."
msgstr ""
"Tu tarjeta SD está esperando reparación. No se puede guardar nada nuevo en "
"ella."

#: internal/settings/storage_ui.c
msgid "Your SD card is write-protected"
msgstr "Tu tarjeta SD está protegida contra escritura"

#: cmd/jawaka-launcher/main.c
